<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fātĭdĭcus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		fatum-dico, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that predicts future events</i>, <i>prophesying</i>, <i>prophetic</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui futura praedivinando soleant fari, fatidici
					dicti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 6, § 52</span></i>
			 Müll.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vates,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 8, 340</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 3, 348</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Themis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 1, 321</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 1, 8, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Apollo</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					2, 262</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Galb. 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">augurium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 29, 36, § 120</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulmina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					43, 43, § 113</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">specus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					93, 95, § 208</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">libri,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the Sibylline</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 31</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silvae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 1, 304</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fātĭdĭcus</span></b> ,
				i, m., <i>a prophet</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cic.
				Leg. 2, 8, 20</span></i>.</div>
